{
  "id": "person-identity",
  "title": "Person Identity Access",
  "description": "The agent obtains a person token (aa-person+jwt) from its PS for one resource and presents it via Signature-Key in place of its agent token. The resource learns which person the agent acts for and serves on that identity alone — no resource token, no auth token, and the PS is never in the path of a call. When an endpoint needs more than identity, the resource challenges there with requirement=auth-token, and the resource token it issues copies ps, sub and the person token's jti out of the token it just verified.",
  "spec_section": "§ Person Token / § Person Identity Access",
  "category": "access",
  "demo_phase": 3,
  "participants": [
    {
      "id": "agent",
      "label": "Agent",
      "type": "agent"
    },
    {
      "id": "resource",
      "label": "Resource",
      "type": "resource"
    },
    {
      "id": "ps",
      "label": "Person Server",
      "type": "person-server"
    }
  ],
  "token_flow": [
    {
      "token": "person-token",
      "label": "Person Token",
      "tokenType": "aa-person+jwt",
      "accent": "auth",
      "events": [
        {
          "step": 1,
          "participant": "resource",
          "label": "Resource challenges: requirement=person-token",
          "kind": "returned"
        },
        {
          "step": 2,
          "participant": "ps",
          "label": "PS issues aud=api.example, directed sub, cnf=agent key",
          "kind": "issued"
        },
        {
          "step": 3,
          "participant": "resource",
          "label": "Presented via Signature-Key in place of the agent token",
          "kind": "presented"
        },
        {
          "step": 4,
          "participant": "resource",
          "label": "Verified again; its ps/sub/jti are copied into the resource token",
          "kind": "presented"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "step": 1,
      "from": "agent",
      "to": "resource",
      "label": "Signed GET /me with agent token → 401 requirement=person-token",
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "https://api.example/me",
      "request_headers": {
        "Host": "api.example",
        "Signature-Key": "sig=jwt;jwt=\"eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSIsImtpZCI6ImFnZW50LWtleS0xIiwidHlwIjoiYWEtYWdlbnQrand0In0…\"",
        "Signature-Input": "sig=(\"@method\" \"@authority\" \"@path\" \"signature-key\");created=1700000000;alg=\"ed25519\"",
        "Signature": "sig=:Hh4eHh4eHh4eHh4eHh4eHh4eHh4eHh4eHh4eHh4eHh4eHh4eHh4eHh4eHh4eHh4eHh4eHh4eHh4eHh4eHh4eHg:"
      },
      "request_body": null,
      "response_status": 401,
      "response_headers": {
        "AAuth-Requirement": "requirement=person-token"
      },
      "response_body": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "name": "Agent Token",
          "typ": "aa-agent+jwt",
          "raw": "eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSIsImtpZCI6ImFnZW50LWtleS0xIiwidHlwIjoiYWEtYWdlbnQrand0In0..8byvGd-PR3uOLeS_HYOpbW7OD_8whUuDRnadQOL83-3jp5V_zwPUkKvBZ-WmB26EaWGey4bVktpWtpykEOy_Bw",
          "header": {
            "alg": "EdDSA",
            "kid": "agent-key-1",
            "typ": "aa-agent+jwt"
          },
          "payload": {
            "iss": "https://agent.example",
            "dwk": "aauth-agent.json",
            "sub": "aauth:local@agent.example",
            "jti": "a6ae301d-1dc7-4b75-8f8b-5612197664a7",
            "cnf": {
              "jwk": {
                "kty": "OKP",
                "crv": "Ed25519",
                "x": "T_1-DXNIxIv0tFEqrD9q4LHu4VcHJgsiDPN__R1_Y2U",
                "kid": "agent-key-1"
              }
            },
            "ps": "https://ps.example",
            "iat": 1776222894,
            "exp": 1776226494
          },
          "signature_b64": "8byvGd-PR3uOLeS_HYOpbW7OD_8whUuDRnadQOL83-3jp5V_zwPUkKvBZ-WmB26EaWGey4bVktpWtpykEOy_Bw"
        }
      ],
      "signature": {
        "scheme": "jwt",
        "signature_base": "\"@method\": GET\n\"@authority\": api.example\n\"@path\": /me\n\"signature-key\": sig=jwt;jwt=\"eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSIsImtpZCI6ImFnZW50LWtleS0xIiwidHlwIjoiYWEtYWdlbnQrand0In0…\"\n\"@signature-params\": (\"@method\" \"@authority\" \"@path\" \"signature-key\");created=1700000000;alg=\"ed25519\"",
        "signature_input": "sig=(\"@method\" \"@authority\" \"@path\" \"signature-key\");created=1700000000;alg=\"ed25519\"",
        "signature_key": "sig=jwt;jwt=\"eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSIsImtpZCI6ImFnZW50LWtleS0xIiwidHlwIjoiYWEtYWdlbnQrand0In0…\"",
        "covered_components": [
          "@method",
          "@authority",
          "@path",
          "signature-key"
        ]
      },
      "annotations": [
        "The agent signs with its agent token. That identifies the agent, not the person.",
        "The resource needs to know which person it is serving, so it answers 401 with requirement=person-token. The header carries no parameters — the agent already knows where to get one.",
        "An agent with no PS cannot satisfy this requirement and surfaces it as an error."
      ],
      "is_response": false
    },
    {
      "step": 2,
      "from": "agent",
      "to": "ps",
      "label": "POST /person {resource} → 200 person_token",
      "method": "POST",
      "url": "https://ps.example/person",
      "request_headers": {
        "Host": "ps.example",
        "Content-Type": "application/json",
        "Content-Digest": "sha-256=:X48E9qOokqqrvdts8nOJRJN3OWDUoyWxBf7kbu9DBPE=:",
        "Signature-Key": "sig=jwt;jwt=\"eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSIsImtpZCI6ImFnZW50LWtleS0xIiwidHlwIjoiYWEtYWdlbnQrand0In0…\"",
        "Signature-Input": "sig=(\"@method\" \"@authority\" \"@path\" \"content-type\" \"content-digest\" \"signature-key\");created=1700000000;alg=\"ed25519\"",
        "Signature": "sig=:UGVyc29uVG9rZW5SZXF1ZXN0U2lnbmF0dXJlQnl0ZXNIZXJlUGVyc29uVG9rZW5SZXF1ZXN0U2ln:"
      },
      "request_body": {
        "resource": "https://api.example"
      },
      "response_status": 200,
      "response_headers": {
        "Content-Type": "application/json",
        "Cache-Control": "no-store"
      },
      "response_body": {
        "person_token": "eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSIsImtpZCI6InBzLWtleS0xIiwidHlwIjoiYWEtcGVyc29uK2p3dCJ9…",
        "expires_in": 3600
      },
      "tokens": [
        {
          "name": "Person Token",
          "typ": "aa-person+jwt",
          "raw": "eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSIsImtpZCI6InBzLWtleS0xIiwidHlwIjoiYWEtcGVyc29uK2p3dCJ9..cGVyc29uVG9rZW5TaWduYXR1cmVJc3N1ZWRCeVRoZVBlcnNvblNlcnZlckV4YW1wbGVWYWx1ZQ",
          "header": {
            "alg": "EdDSA",
            "kid": "ps-key-1",
            "typ": "aa-person+jwt"
          },
          "payload": {
            "iss": "https://ps.example",
            "dwk": "aauth-person.json",
            "aud": "https://api.example",
            "sub": "8f14e45fceea167a5a36dedd4bea2543",
            "cnf": {
              "jwk": {
                "kty": "OKP",
                "crv": "Ed25519",
                "x": "T_1-DXNIxIv0tFEqrD9q4LHu4VcHJgsiDPN__R1_Y2U",
                "kid": "agent-key-1"
              }
            },
            "jti": "pt-32d653",
            "iat": 1776222894,
            "exp": 1776226494
          },
          "signature_b64": "cGVyc29uVG9rZW5TaWduYXR1cmVJc3N1ZWRCeVRoZVBlcnNvblNlcnZlckV4YW1wbGVWYWx1ZQ"
        }
      ],
      "signature": {
        "scheme": "jwt",
        "signature_base": "\"@method\": POST\n\"@authority\": ps.example\n\"@path\": /person\n\"content-type\": application/json\n\"content-digest\": sha-256=:X48E9qOokqqrvdts8nOJRJN3OWDUoyWxBf7kbu9DBPE=:\n\"signature-key\": sig=jwt;jwt=\"eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSIsImtpZCI6ImFnZW50LWtleS0xIiwidHlwIjoiYWEtYWdlbnQrand0In0…\"\n\"@signature-params\": (\"@method\" \"@authority\" \"@path\" \"content-type\" \"content-digest\" \"signature-key\");created=1700000000;alg=\"ed25519\"",
        "signature_input": "sig=(\"@method\" \"@authority\" \"@path\" \"content-type\" \"content-digest\" \"signature-key\");created=1700000000;alg=\"ed25519\"",
        "signature_key": "sig=jwt;jwt=\"eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSIsImtpZCI6ImFnZW50LWtleS0xIiwidHlwIjoiYWEtYWdlbnQrand0In0…\"",
        "covered_components": [
          "@method",
          "@authority",
          "@path",
          "content-type",
          "content-digest",
          "signature-key"
        ]
      },
      "annotations": [
        "The agent signs the request with its agent token. resource is REQUIRED and becomes the aud of the issued token; mission_s256 is OPTIONAL and absent here (see the missions scenarios for the mission case).",
        "The request carries a body, so content-type and content-digest are covered components as well as signature-key.",
        "The PS issues aa-person+jwt: aud = the one resource named, sub = the directed identifier the PS uses for that resource, cnf.jwk = the agent's signing key.",
        "The token carries no scope and no account. It is identity, not authorization — a resource MUST reject it wherever an auth token is required.",
        "A person token MUST NOT live longer than 1 hour, nor outlive the agent token presented to obtain it. The agent caches it per resource rather than requesting one per call.",
        "The PS MAY instead return 202 with requirement=interaction and ask the person first. Because a resource may serve on identity alone, the question is whether this agent may act at the resource as them — not merely whether it may name them."
      ],
      "is_response": false
    },
    {
      "step": 3,
      "from": "agent",
      "to": "resource",
      "label": "Signed GET /me with the person token → 200",
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "https://api.example/me",
      "request_headers": {
        "Host": "api.example",
        "Signature-Key": "sig=jwt;jwt=\"eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSIsImtpZCI6InBzLWtleS0xIiwidHlwIjoiYWEtcGVyc29uK2p3dCJ9…\"",
        "Signature-Input": "sig=(\"@method\" \"@authority\" \"@path\" \"signature-key\");created=1700000060;alg=\"ed25519\"",
        "Signature": "sig=:UHJlc2VudGluZ1RoZVBlcnNvblRva2VuT25BU2lnbmVkUmVxdWVzdEV4YW1wbGVCeXRlcw:"
      },
      "request_body": null,
      "response_status": 200,
      "response_headers": {
        "Content-Type": "application/json"
      },
      "response_body": {
        "person": "8f14e45fceea167a5a36dedd4bea2543",
        "issuer": "https://ps.example",
        "display_name": "Account holder",
        "plan": "team"
      },
      "tokens": [
        {
          "name": "Person Token",
          "typ": "aa-person+jwt",
          "raw": "eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSIsImtpZCI6InBzLWtleS0xIiwidHlwIjoiYWEtcGVyc29uK2p3dCJ9..cGVyc29uVG9rZW5TaWduYXR1cmVJc3N1ZWRCeVRoZVBlcnNvblNlcnZlckV4YW1wbGVWYWx1ZQ",
          "header": {
            "alg": "EdDSA",
            "kid": "ps-key-1",
            "typ": "aa-person+jwt"
          },
          "payload": {
            "iss": "https://ps.example",
            "dwk": "aauth-person.json",
            "aud": "https://api.example",
            "sub": "8f14e45fceea167a5a36dedd4bea2543",
            "cnf": {
              "jwk": {
                "kty": "OKP",
                "crv": "Ed25519",
                "x": "T_1-DXNIxIv0tFEqrD9q4LHu4VcHJgsiDPN__R1_Y2U",
                "kid": "agent-key-1"
              }
            },
            "jti": "pt-32d653",
            "iat": 1776222894,
            "exp": 1776226494
          },
          "signature_b64": "cGVyc29uVG9rZW5TaWduYXR1cmVJc3N1ZWRCeVRoZVBlcnNvblNlcnZlckV4YW1wbGVWYWx1ZQ"
        }
      ],
      "signature": {
        "scheme": "jwt",
        "signature_base": "\"@method\": GET\n\"@authority\": api.example\n\"@path\": /me\n\"signature-key\": sig=jwt;jwt=\"eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSIsImtpZCI6InBzLWtleS0xIiwidHlwIjoiYWEtcGVyc29uK2p3dCJ9…\"\n\"@signature-params\": (\"@method\" \"@authority\" \"@path\" \"signature-key\");created=1700000060;alg=\"ed25519\"",
        "signature_input": "sig=(\"@method\" \"@authority\" \"@path\" \"signature-key\");created=1700000060;alg=\"ed25519\"",
        "signature_key": "sig=jwt;jwt=\"eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSIsImtpZCI6InBzLWtleS0xIiwidHlwIjoiYWEtcGVyc29uK2p3dCJ9…\"",
        "covered_components": [
          "@method",
          "@authority",
          "@path",
          "signature-key"
        ]
      },
      "annotations": [
        "The person token replaces the agent token in Signature-Key. Its cnf.jwk is the same key, so signature verification is unchanged.",
        "The resource verifies typ=aa-person+jwt, fetches the PS's JWKS at {iss}/.well-known/aauth-person.json, checks aud is itself, and checks cnf.jwk against the key that signed the request.",
        "It treats (iss, sub) as the identifier and the sub value as opaque. A sub from a different PS is a different subject however the strings compare.",
        "This is federated login for agents: the resource decides what identity alone entitles the person to, exactly as it would after a login it ran itself.",
        "No resource token, no auth token, and the PS is not in the path of this call."
      ],
      "is_response": false
    },
    {
      "step": 4,
      "from": "agent",
      "to": "resource",
      "label": "POST /documents (sensitive) → 401 requirement=auth-token + resource token",
      "method": "POST",
      "url": "https://api.example/documents",
      "request_headers": {
        "Host": "api.example",
        "Content-Type": "application/json",
        "Signature-Key": "sig=jwt;jwt=\"eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSIsImtpZCI6InBzLWtleS0xIiwidHlwIjoiYWEtcGVyc29uK2p3dCJ9…\"",
        "Signature-Input": "sig=(\"@method\" \"@authority\" \"@path\" \"signature-key\");created=1700000120;alg=\"ed25519\"",
        "Signature": "sig=:U3RlcFVwQ2hhbGxlbmdlUmVxdWVzdFNpZ25hdHVyZUJ5dGVzRXhhbXBsZVZhbHVlSGVyZQ:"
      },
      "request_body": {
        "title": "Q2 summary",
        "body": "…"
